","order":9},{"op":"node_add","widgetId":"phases","id":"p10","label":"iOS — App Store","marker":"Later","order":10},{"op":"node_flag","widgetId":"phases","id":"p8","question":"Has the 14-day closed-test clock started, and how many testers are opted in? Nothing in the repo records it after 1 Aug."},{"op":"widget_create","id":"backlog","type":"table","title":"Backlog"},{"op":"table_set_columns","widgetId":"backlog","columns":[{"id":"item","label":"Item"},{"id":"status","label":"Status"},{"id":"why","label":"Why it matters"}]},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r1","cells":{"item":"Google Play closed test → production","status":"In progress","why":"The critical path now — a process gate, not code"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r2","cells":{"item":"Stop caching the per-turn context snapshot (Claude)","status":"Open","why":"Biggest cost lever — the snapshot changes every turn, so it is a cache write each time. Fix in chat.ts:412"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r3","cells":{"item":"Reconsider new-account transcription default","status":"Open","why":"gpt-4o-transcribe costs more than gpt-4o-mini-transcribe"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r4","cells":{"item":"Remove vestigial seedRecurringToday","status":"Open","why":"Queries the wrong collection and only logs"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r5","cells":{"item":"Remove legacy magic-link files","status":"Open","why":"(auth)/callback.tsx and lib/emailStore.ts are unused"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r6","cells":{"item":"PROJECT_CONTEXT.md still says 100 msgs/day","status":"Open","why":"Default is now 10, per user, chat and voice counted separately"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r7","cells":{"item":"Verify PRICING table against invoices","status":"Open","why":"Hand-maintained; the usage ledger is only as right as it"}},{"op":"row_add","widgetId":"backlog","id":"r8","cells":{"item":"Keyboard fix for the other 5 drawers","status":"Wat